Eigen is a C++ template library for linear algebra, geometry and numerical
algorithms. It supports dense and sparse matrices, fixed and dynamic sizes,
decompositions, solvers, explicit vectorization and expression templates.

The common provider retains the math/eigen3 package path, include/eigen3,
Eigen3::Eigen CMake target and eigen3.pc. Eigen 5 requires C++14. Its CMake
version checks follow semantic versioning; consumers that accept both Eigen
3 and Eigen 5 must request an appropriate version range.
